CzEg7GDAH3EzqmDFxEqaEcTTc4ozFKrMSWNqTzZaqDpQls2TVLFj04Uiaxe81OyAx6ICfGvGyeTTDmcW4ibYFY855M%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5a4871a0&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_gif%2FOmCbZ5JK30GbpbpADRYqgC6MMvNfRPY8cGySPF2f9miavJibvCOiaUelcS2LX6uSMGEic1ztD9ECCvN2rcupEseySg%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%26tp%3Dwebp", "type": "photo", "width": 840, "height": 1028, "blurhash": "LKR:HIfQ~pof9Gay-;j[%Mj[M|fQ"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=fd319dfb&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_gif%2FOmCbZ5JK30GMpsz1kdxGBRiclB5yjhBh5iamZLYrF2BOK4YNhXbjibibx63B6o5ubgOvYGRyUa0DK6gpI9YibkKUUCQ%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%26tp%3Dwebp", "type": "photo", "width": 0, "height": 0, "blurhash": ""}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "OpenSandbox, Alibaba's open-source AI Agent sandbox platform, introduced Credential Vault to prevent real credentials from entering sandbox environments. Instead of storing API keys, tokens, or passwords inside the sandbox, Credential Vault keeps them outside and injects authentication headers via an egress sidecar when outbound requests match predefined rules. The sandbox only receives fake or placeholder values.\n\nThis approach mitigates risks from prompt injection, malicious dependencies, and log leaks. It supports model APIs, Git operations, and internal API calls with fine-grained bindings to specific hosts, paths, and methods. Credential Vault requires default-deny network policies and does not work alongside transparent service mesh sidecars like Istio or Envoy in the same sandbox pod."}, "settings": {}}